  "description": "This package enables applications to access and parse the Trusted Service List (TSL) of qualified electronic trust service providers in Spain. The TSL is published in compliance with Commission Implementing Decision (EU) 2015/1505 and Regulation (EU) No 910/2014 (eIDAS).\n\nTSL XML is downloaded from the official Spanish government source and deserialized into C# objects for further inspection and integration. Useful for applications dealing with electronic signature validation, PKI, or trust services auditing.",
